{{also|schalen|Schalen}}
==German==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|de|gmh|scheln}}, {{m|gmh|schelen}}, from {{inh|de|goh|skelen}}, {{m|goh|skellen}}, from the noun {{m|goh|scala}}, from {{inh|de|gem-pro|*skalō}}, from {{der|de|ine-pro|*(s)kelH-|t=to cut, divide}} or {{m|ine-pro|*ḱel-|*(s)kel-|t=to cover}}. Cognate with {{cog|bar|schäin}}, {{m|bar|schöln}}, {{m|bar|schön}}, and {{cog|yi|שיילן}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|de|/ˈʃɛːlən/}} {{qualifier|standard; used naturally in western Germany and Switzerland}}
* {{IPA|de|/ˈʃeːlən/}} {{qualifier|overall more common; particularly northern and eastern regions}}
* {{audio|de|De-schälen.ogg}}
* {{hyphenation|de|schä|len}}

